  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Titus",
    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 2,
    "summary": "Saints should live righteously, deny ungodliness, and seek the Lord.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "But speak thou the things which become sound doctrine:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 9,
            "text": "1 Thes. 2:4; 1 Pet. 4:11. TG Teaching."
          },
          {
            "start": 45,
            "end": 53,
            "text": "D&C 88:77 (77–78)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "That the aged men be sober, grave, temperate, sound in faith, in charity, in patience.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 9,
            "end": 13,
            "text": "TG Old Age."
          },
          {
            "start": 21,
            "end": 26,
            "text": "GR circumspect."
          },
          {
            "start": 35,
            "end": 44,
            "text": "TG Temperance."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The aged women likewise, that they be in behaviour as becometh holiness, not false accusers, not given to much wine, teachers of good things;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 77,
            "end": 82,
            "text": "GR slanderers, traitors, devils."
          },
          {
            "start": 83,
            "end": 91,
            "text": "TG Gossip."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 30,
            "end": 37
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "That they may teach the young women to be sober, to love their husbands, to love their children,",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 30,
            "end": 35,
            "text": "TG Marriage, Wives."
          },
          {
            "start": 52,
            "end": 56,
            "text": "TG Family, Love within."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "To be discreet, chaste, keepers at home, good, obedient to their own husbands, that the word of God be not blasphemed.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 16,
            "end": 22,
            "text": "TG Chastity; Modesty."
          },
          {
            "start": 24,
            "end": 31,
            "text": "GR housekeepers, guards."
          },
          {
            "start": 35,
            "end": 39,
            "text": "1 Tim. 5:14."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 5
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Young men likewise exhort to be sober minded.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "In all things shewing thyself a pattern of good works: in doctrine shewing uncorruptness, gravity, sincerity,",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 90,
            "end": 97,
            "text": "GR dignity, respectfulness."
          },
          {
            "start": 99,
            "end": 108,
            "text": "TG Sincere."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 67,
            "end": 74
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Sound speech, that cannot be condemned; that he that is of the contrary part may be ashamed, having no evil thing to say of you.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 5,
            "text": "1 Tim. 6:3."
          },
          {
            "start": 29,
            "end": 38,
            "text": "1 Pet. 2:12 (11–12)."
          },
          {
            "start": 56,
            "end": 76,
            "text": "GR an opponent, enemy."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Exhort servants to be obedient unto their own masters, and to please them well in all things; not answering again;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 7,
            "end": 15,
            "text": "Eph. 6:5; Col. 3:22; 1 Tim. 6:1 (1–2); 1 Pet. 2:18."
          },
          {
            "start": 98,
            "end": 113,
            "text": "GR arguing against, opposing, contradicting."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 6
          },
          {
            "start": 55,
            "end": 58
          },
          {
            "start": 69,
            "end": 73
          },
          {
            "start": 86,
            "end": 93
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Not purloining, but shewing all good fidelity; that they may adorn the doctrine of God our Saviour in all things.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 14,
            "text": "GR misappropriating, robbing. TG Stealing."
          },
          {
            "start": 61,
            "end": 66,
            "text": "GR honor, put in order."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For the grace of God that bringeth salvation hath appeared to all men,",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 13,
            "text": "TG Grace."
          },
          {
            "start": 21,
            "end": 25,
            "text": "JST Titus 2:11 … which bringeth salvation to all men, hath appeared;"
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Teaching us that, denying ungodliness and worldly lusts, we should live soberly, righteously, and godly, in this present world;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 26,
            "end": 37,
            "text": "TG Godliness."
          },
          {
            "start": 42,
            "end": 49,
            "text": "TG Worldliness."
          },
          {
            "start": 50,
            "end": 55,
            "text": "TG Lust."
          },
          {
            "start": 72,
            "end": 79,
            "text": "TG Levity."
          },
          {
            "start": 81,
            "end": 92,
            "text": "TG Abundant Life; Righteousness."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Looking for that blessed hope, and the glorious appearing of the great God and our Saviour Jesus Christ;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 39,
            "end": 47,
            "text": "TG Glory."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Who gave himself for us, that he might redeem us from all iniquity, and purify unto himself a peculiar people, zealous of good works.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 9,
            "end": 16,
            "text": "TG Self-Sacrifice."
          },
          {
            "start": 39,
            "end": 45,
            "text": "TG Jesus Christ, Atonement through; Jesus Christ, Redeemer; Redemption."
          },
          {
            "start": 72,
            "end": 78,
            "text": "TG Purification; Purity."
          },
          {
            "start": 94,
            "end": 109,
            "text": "TG Peculiar People."
          },
          {
            "start": 111,
            "end": 118,
            "text": "TG Zeal."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "These things speak, and exhort, and rebuke with all authority. Let no man despise thee.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 36,
            "end": 42,
            "text": "TG Chastening."
          },
          {
            "start": 52,
            "end": 61,
            "text": "TG Authority."
          },
          {
            "start": 74,
            "end": 81,
            "text": "GR disregard."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      }
    ]
  },
